    "text": "For <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>,</mo></math> in the expansion of <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mroot><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mroot><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mroot><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mroot></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math>, the sum of all the binomial coefficients lie between <math><mn>200</mn></math> and <math><mn>400.</mn></math>&nbsp;Also, the term independent of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is <math><mn>448,</mn></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math>is"
  },
