    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>…</mo><msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>400</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>400</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>T</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>8</mn></msup><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mroot><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mn>4</mn></mroot></mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mroot><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mroot></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>8</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />For this term to be independent of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mtext>T</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mn>448</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
